 "sq": [
  {
   "_id": 10412,
   "ANSWER": "<p>Declarative programming focuses on describing <em data-end=\"2808\" data-start=\"2802\">what</em> the program should accomplish. SQL is a declarative language because users state what data is needed without specifying how to retrieve it. For example: <code data-end=\"3012\" data-start=\"2962\">SELECT name FROM employees WHERE salary &gt; 50000;</code></p>\n",
   "COURSE_CODE": "21CSC203P",
   "LEVEL": 2,
   "OUTCOMES": [
    "PLO1",
    "PLO3",
    "PLO4"
   ],
   "QUESTION_DESC": "<p>Define declarative programming and explain how SQL represents this paradigm in databases.<br data-end=\"2740\" data-start=\"2737\" />\n<br data-end=\"2756\" data-start=\"2753\" />\n&nbsp;</p>\n",
   "SESSION_ID": 305,
   "TYPE": "sq",
   "key": 10412
  },
  {
   "_id": 10413,
   "ANSWER": "<ul data-end=\"3425\" data-start=\"3095\">\n\t<li data-end=\"3146\" data-start=\"3095\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3146\" data-start=\"3097\"><strong data-end=\"3110\" data-start=\"3097\">JDBC API:</strong> Provides interfaces for DB access</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3201\" data-start=\"3147\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3201\" data-start=\"3149\"><strong data-end=\"3173\" data-start=\"3149\">JDBC Driver Manager:</strong> Loads and manages drivers</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3275\" data-start=\"3202\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3275\" data-start=\"3204\"><strong data-end=\"3221\" data-start=\"3204\">JDBC Drivers:</strong> Vendor-specific implementations to interact with DB</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3318\" data-start=\"3276\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3318\" data-start=\"3278\"><strong data-end=\"3293\" data-start=\"3278\">Connection:</strong> Establishes link to DB</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3386\" data-start=\"3319\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3386\" data-start=\"3321\"><strong data-end=\"3371\" data-start=\"3321\">Statement/PreparedStatement/CallableStatement:</strong> Executes SQL</p>\n\t</li>\n\t<li data-end=\"3425\" data-start=\"3387\">\n\t<p data-end=\"3425\" data-start=\"3389\"><strong data-end=\"3403\" data-start=\"3389\">ResultSet:</strong> Stores retrieved data</p>\n\t</li>\n</ul>\n",
